stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<rect fill=\"Gainsboro\" stroke=\"none\" width=\"1569\" height=\"1505\" x=\"0\" y=\"-301\"></rect>\n<g>\n<g transform=\"translate(300,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(500,412)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-6B\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-3E\" x=\"1847\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2903,0)\">\n<rect fill=\"Gainsboro\" stroke=\"none\" width=\"1622\" height=\"1307\" x=\"0\" y=\"-312\"></rect>\n<g>\n<g transform=\"translate(300,0)\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMAIN-32\"></use>\n</g>\n<g fill=\"blue\" stroke=\"blue\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E14-MJMATHI-6B\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Then, we move on to the <strong>inductive step</strong>: We must show that <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"17.796ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 7662 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-15-Title\">P(k) \\Rightarrow P(k+1).</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E15-MJMATHI-50\" d=\"M287 628Q287 635 230 637Q206 637 199 638T192 648Q192 649 194 659Q200 679 203 681T397 683Q587 682 600 680Q664 669 707 631T751 530Q751 453 685 389Q616 321 507 303Q500 302 402 301H307L277 182Q247 66 247 59Q247 55 248 54T255 50T272 48T305 46H336Q342 37 342 35Q342 19 335 5Q330 0 319 0Q316 0 282 1T182 2Q120 2 87 2T51