 129 405Q91 405 66 305Q60 285 60 284Q58 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-2208\" d=\"M84 250Q84 372 166 450T360 539Q361 539 377 539T419 540T469 540H568Q583 532 583 520Q583 511 570 501L466 500Q355 499 329 494Q280 482 242 458T183 409T147 354T129 306T124 272V270H568Q583 262 583 250T568 230H124V228Q124 207 134 177T167 112T231 48T328 7Q355 1 466 0H570Q583 -10 583 -20Q583 -32 568 -40H471Q464 -40 446 -40T417 -41Q262 -41 172 45Q84 127 84 250Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJAMS-4E\" d=\"M20 664Q20 666 31 683H142Q256 683 258 681Q259 680 279 653T342 572T422 468L582 259V425Q582 451 582 490T583 541Q583 611 573 628T522 648Q500 648 493 654Q484 665 493 679L500 683H691Q702 676 702 666Q702 657 698 652Q688 648 680 648Q633 648 627 612Q624 601 624 294V-8Q616 -20 607 -20Q601 -20 596 -15Q593 -13 371 270L156 548L153 319Q153 284 153 234T152 167Q152 103 156 78T172 44T213 34Q236 34 242 28Q253 17 242 3L236 -1H36Q24 6 24 16Q24 34 56 34Q58 35 69 36T86 40T100 50T109 72Q111 83 111 345V603L96 619Q72 643 44 648Q20 648 20 664ZM413 419L240 648H120L136 628Q137 626 361 341T587 54L589 68Q589 78 589 121V192L413 419Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E6-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMATHI-6E\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-2208\" x=\"878\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJAMS-4E\" x=\"1823\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E6-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"2546\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Let's recall our general strategy for proving results using induction:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>Step 1</strong>: Base Case</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Step 2</strong>: Inductive Hypothesis</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Step 3</strong>: Inductive Step</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>Step 4</strong>: Conclusion</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>In this lesson, we'll learn how induction is used to prove inequality statements. But first, let's discuss an important property of numbers often used in these proofs.</p>\n\n        </div>",
      "errors": [],
