21Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2C\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M84 250Q84 372 166 450T360 539Q361 539 377 539T419 540T469 540H568Q583 532 583 520Q583 511 570 501L466 500Q355 499 329 494Q280 482 242 458T183 409T147 354T129 306T124 272V270H568Q583 262 583 250T568 230H124V228Q124 207 134 177T167 112T231 48T328 7Q355 1 466 0H570Q583 -10 583 -20Q583 -32 568 -40H471Q464 -40 446 -40T417 -41Q262 -41 172 45Q84 127 84 250Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2208\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M20 664Q20 666 31 683H142Q256 683 258 681Q259 680 279 653T342 572T422 468L582 259V425Q582 451 582 490T583 541Q583 611 573 628T522 648Q500 648 493 654Q484 665 493 679L500 683H691Q702 676 702 666Q702 657 698 652Q688 648 680 648Q633 648 627 612Q624 601 624 294V-8Q616 -20 607 -20Q601 -20 596 -15Q593 -13 371 270L156 548L153 319Q153 284 153 234T152 167Q152 103 156 78T172 44T213 34Q236 34 242 28Q253 17 242 3L236 -1H36Q24 6 24 16Q24 34 56 34Q58 35 69 36T86 40T100 50T109 72Q111 83 111 345V603L96 619Q72 643 44 648Q20 648 20 664ZM413 419L240 648H120L136 628Q137 626 361 341T587 54L589 68Q589 78 589 121V192L413 419Z\" id=\"E2-MJAMS-4E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"878\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2265\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1934\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-33\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2435\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2C\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2880\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"3758\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2208\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"4703\" xlink:href=\"#E2-MJAMS-4E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>What are the missing entries in the proof template outlined below?</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Base Case</strong>: We first prove that our statement is true for the base case <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"3.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1078.4 3831.5 1510.9\" width=\"8.899ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\\fbox{<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mphantom><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mphantom></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mphantom><mn>000000</mn></mphantom></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>}.</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M96 585Q152 666 249 666Q297 666 345 640T423 548Q460 465 460 320Q460 165 417 83Q397 41 362 16T301 -15T250 -22Q224 -22 198 -16T137 16T82 83Q39 165 39 320Q39 494 96 585ZM321 597Q291 629 250 629Q208 629 178 597Q153 571 145 525T137 333Q137 175 145 125T181 46Q209 16 250 16Q290 16 318 46Q347 76 354 130T362 333Q362 478 354 524T321 597Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-30\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<line stroke-linecap=\"square\" stroke-width=\"75\" transform=\"translate(0,867)\" x1=\"37\" x2=\