stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMATHI-6E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"878\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-3D\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1934,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n<use x=\"500\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\nFor the left-hand side, we have\n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"3.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -1.005ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -934.9 3391 1367.4\" width=\"7.876ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"13\" display=\"true\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 3.048em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"block\" unselectable=\"on\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right\" columnspacing=\"\" displaystyle=\"true\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mn>3